   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>I have been able to add unique css styling via:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">tags$style(type=&quot;text/css&quot;, </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">   &quot;label{ background: red; }&quot;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">)</font></div></div><div><br></div><div><b>Is it possible to link to a css file that is in a folder named &#39;css&#39; under our ShinyApps folder (see location below)?</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-j-RP9zgSe1c/UeVezx_vSoI/AAAAAAAAAZw/CUhV6geDvbI/s1600/Screen+Shot+2013-07-16+at+10.54.52+AM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-j-RP9zgSe1c/UeVezx_vSoI/AAAAAAAAAZw/CUhV6geDvbI/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2013-07-16%2Bat%2B10.54.52%2BAM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792408008684000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1B-wEOkVEuCO6Cns-7LJ3j\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-j-RP9zgSe1c/UeVezx_vSoI/AAAAAAAAAZw/CUhV6geDvbI/s400/Screen+Shot+2013-07-16+at+10.54.52+AM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"78\"></a></p><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I tried the following...</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">tags$style(type=&quot;text/css&quot;, src=&quot;/gsdesign/css/style.css&quot;)</font><br></div><div><br></div><div>and</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">tags$style(type=&quot;text/css&quot;, src=&quot;/gsdesign/ShinyApps/css/style.css&quot;)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">------</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><br></span></div><div>Maybe only R code can run in folders, if that is the case, inline css will be fine.</div><div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>John</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
