\n\r\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">------</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><br></span></div><div>Maybe only R code can run in folders, if that is the case, inline css will be fine.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>All the best,</div><div>John</div></blockquote></div></div>"
